  "operation": "Retain clone init/activate/play and clear/deactivate/stop order, original duration, player appearance source, zero-mix animation application and empty PreviewTool marker. Expose the animation state through existing read-only appearance ports; replace EC view lookup and split-animation loading with explicit scene dependencies.",
